---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = 'June 27, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy – 4aNurse"
  description="How 4aNurse collects, uses, and protects your information. We use privacy-friendly analytics, never sell your data, and participate in the Amazon Associates program."
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="about-lead">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how 4aNurse.com ("4aNurse," "we," "us," or "our"), a brand of Easy-RN, LLC, handles information in connection with your use of this website. By using the site, you agree to the practices described here.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Who We Are</h2>
      <p>4aNurse is a gift-recommendation website. We publish curated gift guides and product recommendations for nurses. We do not sell products directly — purchases are completed on third-party retailers such as Amazon. You do not need an account to use this site.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul class="about-list">
        <li><strong>Information you give us.</strong> If you contact us or submit a gift suggestion through a form, we collect the information you choose to provide — typically your name, email address, and your message.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage analytics.</strong> We use privacy-friendly analytics (Plausible) to understand aggregate traffic — pages viewed, referring sites, country, and device type. This data is aggregated and does not use cookies or identify you personally.</li>
        <li><strong>What we do not collect.</strong> We do not collect payment or financial information — all purchases are handled by the retailer (e.g., Amazon). We do not require registration and do not knowingly build personal profiles of visitors.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Cookies &amp; Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>Our analytics provider does not use tracking cookies. However, when you click an affiliate link to a retailer such as Amazon, that retailer may place cookies on your device to attribute any resulting purchase to us. Those cookies are governed by the retailer's own privacy policy, not ours. You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
      <ul class="about-list">
        <li>To respond to your messages and gift submissions.</li>
        <li>To understand, in aggregate, how the site is used and to improve our content.</li>
        <li>To operate, maintain, and secure the website.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or trade your personal information.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Third Parties</h2>
      <p>We rely on a small number of service providers to run the site, including our web host, our analytics provider (Plausible), and affiliate programs such as the Amazon Associates Program. When you click through to a third-party site, your information is handled under that site's privacy policy. We encourage you to review the policies of any site you visit.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on where you live (for example, under the GDPR or CCPA), you may have the right to access, correct, or delete the personal information you have provided to us, or to ask us not to use it. To make a request, email us at <a href="mailto:contact@4anurse.com">contact@4anurse.com</a> and we will respond within a reasonable time.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>This site is intended for a general, adult audience and is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the "Last updated" date above. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the updated policy.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:contact@4anurse.com">contact@4anurse.com</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
